{%- comment -%}
  The bag count on its own, as plain text.

  /cart.js reports `has_components: true` for a bundle line but never says how
  many components it holds, so JavaScript cannot work the garment count out for
  itself. This alternate cart view answers it from Liquid, where the components
  ARE readable, and crooks-bag.js fetches it after anything that changes the
  cart. Reached at {{ routes.cart_url }}?view=crk-count.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- layout none -%}{%- render 'crooks-bag-count' -%}
